cephalanthus occidentalis or buttonbush  this is a fairly large shrub found in  wet areas  but also pretty drought tolerant it gets  its name from its distinctive  flower which is a good id feature this  kind of white  button like flower that comes in late  summer  and is pretty persistent for the rest of  the growing season  button bush is opposite leaved or  whirled so you can have more than two  leaves  at a node so this is cephalanthus  occidentalis buttonbush
 

